Maplewing is licensed in parts (matching rocket-odyssey):

  Code: simulator, website, desktop app and tools (sim/, web/, docs/assets/js, desktop/, tools/)
      MIT                            LICENSES/MIT.txt
  Documentation, CAD models and data (README, notes/, cad/, exports/, docs/ text and images, sim/*.json)
      CC BY-SA 4.0                   LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt
  Logger printed circuit board (when published, pcb/)
      CERN-OHL-S-2.0                 LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt

Third-party files keep their own licences: docs/vendor/three (MIT), docs/vendor/katex (MIT),
docs/vendor/fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1). Motor thrust curves in sim/motors come from
ThrustCurve.org simfiles, cited per motor in sim/motors/motors.json.
